    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "e6010e421152083539b259b16f3c9856",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-001_Gross-price-structure-new-established-MVD-portfolio. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. Sign up (English version)     \n\nRepnews  \n\n  \n\n2025-02-04 | #001  \n\nGross price structure of the new established MVD Safety Shutoff Valve portfolio\n\nThe new established standard portfolio of the MVD Safety Shutoff Valve portfolio will be available for sale from April 1st. 2025.\n\nAs previously announced (RepNews 2024-015), please find below the timeline for the existing available standard versions from Rp 3/8” to Rp 2 ½”. The phase out will take place by the end of Q2/2025 (June 30th., 2025).",
