  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "2b6ceb1761d2db31f63cb86b0bc663f8",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-001_Gross-price-structure-new-established-MVD-portfolio. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. There will be a last time buy option until the end of Q1/2025 (March 31st., 2025).\n\nSpare parts will be available until the end of Q4/2025 (Dec. 31st. 2025).\n\nAccessories like the K01 limit switch will fit to the new established portfolio as well.\n\nAffected products\n\nThe pricing structure of the new established MVD versions can be found in the attached Excel file. Gross prices are based on the current pricing of the 200 mbar versions.",
